---
layout: base.njk
title: Get involved
permalink: /get-involved/
description: "Volunteer, become a brand ambassador, sponsor an event, or play one. How to work with DC Social Collective."
---
<div class="wrap page-head">
  <h1>Get involved</h1>
  <p class="lede">We are growing the young adult scene in DC, Maryland, and Virginia one event at a time. There are four ways to help.</p>
</div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap cards">
    <article class="card" id="volunteer"><h2>Volunteer</h2><p>Hosting, planning, hospitality, venue relations, promotion, marketing. Experience is welcome but not required. Tell us what you like doing.</p><a class="btn" href="#contact">Volunteer</a></article>
    <article class="card" id="ambassador"><h2>Be a brand ambassador</h2><p>Ambassadors are the people on the floor who make the room work: welcoming newcomers, pulling people into the lesson, setting the tone. We add a few a year from regulars.</p><a class="btn" href="#contact">Apply</a></article>
    <article class="card" id="sponsor"><h2>Sponsor an event</h2><p>Our nights put a few hundred young professionals in one room. Sponsors get their name on the night, on the site, and in front of the crowd. Venues, restaurants, and local businesses do well here.</p><a class="btn" href="#contact">Talk to us</a></article>
    <article class="card" id="music"><h2>Play our events</h2><p>Live bands and DJs are the center of every night. If you play swing, country, Latin, jazz, or big band, we'd like to hear you.</p><a class="btn" href="#contact">Book your band</a></article>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="band paper" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap two-col" style="align-items:start">
    <div>
      <h2>Tell us about yourself</h2>
      <p>Or write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. We read everything.</p>
      <form class="form" action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.email }}" method="POST">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Get involved form">
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/thanks/">
        <label>Name <input type="text" name="name" required></label>
        <label>Email <input type="email" name="email" required></label>
        <label>I'm interested in
          <select name="interest"><option>Volunteering</option><option>Becoming a brand ambassador</option><option>Sponsoring an event</option><option>Playing at an event</option><option>Something else</option></select>
        </label>
        <label>Tell us more <textarea name="message" rows="5"></textarea></label>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Send</button>
      </form>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/gallery/22.jpg" alt="A live band on stage at a DSC night" loading="lazy" width="2500" height="1667">
  </div>
</section>
